window-todo combines code from three MIT-licensed mods:

- claude-mod-todo-list 0.3.1 by 0xnicholasy
  https://github.com/0xnicholasy/claude-mod-todo-list
  The plan layer: the plan tool, the pane and status line, the gate, and their tests.

- claude-todo-list by Chienlung Huang and other contributors
  https://github.com/cldotdev/claude-todo-list
  The observer loop on a small model and the per-session store of the window list.

- pinboard by Jerad Bitner
  https://github.com/sirkitree/pinboard
  The Stop reminder for a question the window list does not carry.
